OL,3,GNEWSA'I want flipping world record in
OL,4,Abrother's memory'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager is aiming to set a world
OL,7,Frecord for the most backwards
OL,8,Fsomersaults in 24 hours in memory of
OL,9,Fhis late brother.
OL,11,FEngineering apprentice Austin Beasty,
OL,12,F18, from Market Weighton, East
OL,13,FYorkshire, would need to beat the
OL,14,Fcurrent Guinness World Record of 1,234.
OL,15,FHe said he was hoping to complete
OL,16,F2,000.
OL,18,FHis brother, Jaygo, died in a road
OL,19,Ftraffic collision in 2022 when he was
OL,20,F17 and Austin said he would also be
OL,21,Fusing the challenge to raise money for
OL,22,FYorkshire Air Ambulance.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
