OL,3,GNEWSA'I want flipping world record in
OL,4,Abrother's memory'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAustin said: "I know I've put in a
OL,7,Fgreat amount of work. So much training
OL,8,Fhas gone into it, and planning. I'm
OL,9,Fready for the challenge."
